{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1c2e7b4-1f92-4d58-8a1b-pgcsmsge00001",
		"name": "Poct Goyercini (PG365) SMS API v1",
		"description": "Postman collection for sending SMS via Poct Goyercini (PG365) gateway.\n\nEndpoint: `POST https://api.poctgoyercini.com/gateway/api/sms/v1/message/send?publicKey={publicKey}`\n\nAuthentication: `Authorization: Bearer {privateKey}`\n\nBody: JSON — Single Message, Multi-Recipient, Options ilə (Originator, Encoding, SmsType).\n\nResponse: `{ \"Status\": 200, \"Description\": \"\", \"Result\": {...} }` — Status==200 uğurludur.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Send SMS (Walvero / Originator)",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test('Status field == 200', function () {",
							"    var json = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.expect(json.Status).to.eql(200);",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Authorization",
						"value": "Bearer {{privateKey}}",
						"type": "text"
					},
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json",
						"type": "text"
					},
					{
						"key": "Accept",
						"value": "application/json",
						"type": "text"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"Text\": \"{{message}}\",\n    \"Purpose\": \"INF\",\n    \"Options\": {\n        \"Originator\": \"{{originator}}\",\n        \"Encoding\": \"LATIN\",\n        \"SmsType\": \"SMS\"\n    },\n    \"Receivers\": [\n        { \"Receiver\": \"{{receiver}}\" }\n    ]\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/gateway/api/sms/v1/message/send?publicKey={{publicKey}}",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"gateway",
						"api",
						"sms",
						"v1",
						"message",
						"send"
					],
					"query": [
						{
							"key": "publicKey",
							"value": "{{publicKey}}"
						}
					]
				},
				"description": "Tək mətnli SMS-i bir və ya bir neçə alıcıya göndərir.\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Authorization: Bearer {privateKey}` — JWT private key\n- `Content-Type: application/json`\n\n**Query:**\n- `publicKey` — abunəliyin açıq açarı\n\n**Body:**\n```json\n{\n  \"Text\": \"test\",\n  \"Purpose\": \"INF\",\n  \"Options\": {\n    \"Originator\": \"Walvero\",\n    \"Encoding\": \"LATIN\",\n    \"SmsType\": \"SMS\"\n  },\n  \"Receivers\": [\n    { \"Receiver\": \"994551234567\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Response (success):**\n```json\n{\n  \"Status\": 200,\n  \"Description\": \"\",\n  \"Result\": { ... }\n}\n```"
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "Success example",
					"originalRequest": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{privateKey}}" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"Text\": \"test\",\n    \"Purpose\": \"INF\",\n    \"Options\": {\n        \"Originator\": \"Walvero\",\n        \"Encoding\": \"LATIN\",\n        \"SmsType\": \"SMS\"\n    },\n    \"Receivers\": [\n        { \"Receiver\": \"994551234567\" }\n    ]\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/gateway/api/sms/v1/message/send?publicKey={{publicKey}}",
							"host": [ "{{baseUrl}}" ],
							"path": [ "gateway", "api", "sms", "v1", "message", "send" ],
							"query": [ { "key": "publicKey", "value": "{{publicKey}}" } ]
						}
					},
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
					"header": [
						{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
					],
					"cookie": [],
					"body": "{\n    \"Status\": 200,\n    \"Description\": \"\",\n    \"Result\": {\n        \"MessageId\": \"abc123\",\n        \"Accepted\": 1\n    }\n}"
				}
			]
		}
